msgstr "Ensemble de groupes d'unités d'organisation"

msgid ""
"organisationUnitGroups are associated to the organisationUnitGroupSet as a "
"list of services... and each of the organisationUnitGroups have a code."
msgstr ""
"Les organisationUnitGroups sont associés à l'organisationUnitGroupSet comme "
"une liste de services... et chacun des organisationUnitGroups a un code."

msgid "To compile the information in the 'Dossiers' panel, the app reads:"
msgstr "Pour rassembler les informations du panneau 'Dossiers', l'application lit :"

